# Backend URL baked into the packaged .exe at build time. `dist:win` runs
# `electron-vite build`, which loads `.env.production` (mode=production,
# electron-vite's `MAIN_VITE_` prefix convention — see env.d.ts) and inlines
# this value into the main-process bundle as import.meta.env.MAIN_VITE_BACKEND_URL.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.production` and fill in the real apps/api address
# (LAN IP or domain) before building a distributable for real lab machines.
# Still localhost:4000 for now while only the packaging mechanism is being
# verified — an explicit BACKEND_URL env var always overrides this at runtime.
MAIN_VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:4000
